    ],
    "en": [
      "Situated on the D21 Quietiste Military Cemetery is half-way from Le Cateau to Busigny, on the north-west side of the road (D21)."
    ],
    "it": [
      "Situato sulla D21, il cimitero militare di Quietiste si trova a metà strada tra Le Cateau e Busigny, sul lato nord-ovest della strada (D21)."
    ],
    "fr": [
      "Situé sur la D21 Quietiste Military Cemetery is half-way from Le Cateau to Busigny, on the north-west side of the road (D21)."
    ],
